{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Evidence trail for the 2026-08-19 reframe (operator session).\n\n**Gate-shape survey** (all shipped deterministic gates, for \"contract allows X / co-shipped\nartifact forbids X\"): complexity ratchet is the ONLY instance — checker treats `stale>0` alone\nas exit 0 while `test_check_complexity_baseline.py` asserted `stale=0` (now bug\n`dystopian-bardlike-basil`, unfixed on main at survey time). Module-size, commit-trailer\nverifier, DCO, bugfix-size, region-lint gates: each has one artifact or consistent pairs.\nVerdict: one-off, not a pattern ⇒ no standalone criterion; no \"sanctioned-path\" plan-review\nrule (would need to simulate future contributor workflows; distinct from rejected\nci-gate-compat, which targeted EXTERNAL in-flight branches where rebase-and-fix is the remedy).\n\n**Corpus**: 1881 code-v3 sidecars / 1243 changes / 3384 surfaced findings / 1664 `tests`\nfindings. Replay harness reproduces stored v3 priorities 0/3384 mismatch.\n\n**Why tests findings starve under v3**: maint lane = tier × (0.5 + 0.5·min(churn90,30)/30);\nchurn90 absent on 80% ⇒ ×0.5; dominant binary reachable_path_without_automated_coverage\n(0.6) ⇒ priority mass at ~0.30 vs advisory@0.95. Pass-2's prod_impact / trigger_likelihood\nare answered but DISCARDED by that lane. Crosstab of the 1664: prod=none/low = 1120 (internal\nedges, correctly advisory); prod=medium/high = 70 (hand-read: uniformly load-bearing).\nac592f8f55 (created code-v3) added the binary because such findings scored 0.0 before — it\ncreated the 0.3 mass but could not reach the block zone.\n\n**Threshold sweep** (v3 scores, tests findings): ≥0.95: 0. ≥0.54: 11 findings / 11 changes\n(0.9%), 10/11 val=1.0. ≥0.45: 23/20 (1.6%), 96% val≥0.95 — all 23 hand-read true positive.\nRejected as sole fix: lowering the threshold treats the symptom (scores compressed at 0.30 by\nthe churn dampener), and a floor abandons valid sub-threshold findings.\n\n**v3 → v4 replay** (blocking set = secret-detection, high-critical-security, security,\napi-compat@0.51, deletion-impact@0.60, regression@0.54, error-handling@0.50, +tests@0.54):\n- v3 baseline: 61 findings / 42 changes block (3.4%).\n- v4 final: 163 findings / 99 changes (8.0%) — operator-accepted friction.\n- Demotions of currently-blocking findings: 0. Docs/cosmetic entries in new set: 0.\n- prod=none/low internal-edge mass stays advisory (~0.27–0.30).\n- Debt lane churn amplifier-only ([1.0,1.5], per operator: churn may only increase impact):\n  friction unchanged at 8.0% — debt binaries are minor (0.3), cap 0.45 < every threshold.\n- No new validity floor: 0.85–0.95 band hand-read as true positives; val<0.5 drop stands.\n\nGround-truth caveat: docs/experiments/code_review_adjudication.jsonl is a first-pass proxy\n(tier/severity), circular for this purpose — hand-adjudication above was done directly on\nfinding text + diffs."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787191812442472001,"uuid":"b950728a-913b-4ca3-8b43-407505b00b28"}